<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110069" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾰείνω</span></b> , poet. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shine, give light,</i> freq.
			of the sun, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠέλιος δ᾽ ἀνόρουσε . . , ἵν᾽
					ἀθανάτοισι φαείνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				528
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				11.1218a7
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠὼς] ἐπιχθονίοισι φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					372
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν νεκύεσσι, μετ᾽ ἀθανάτοισι φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.383
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				385
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπτῆρας τρεῖς ἵστασαν ἐν μεγάροισιν,
					ὄφρα φαείνοιεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.308
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπτῆρσι φαείνων</span>
			<i>giving light</i> by . . , ib.<i><span class="en">
				343
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			 in same sense, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.42
			</span></i>; <i>appear,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.1362
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος περὶ τοῦδε φαείνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					247.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>bring to light,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόσ᾽ ἑρπετὰ γαῖα φαείνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					390
				</span></i>
			.</div>
